Description: Replace local indexing with the shared TemplarOS Index1 service
 Dedicated bounded worker, generation-aware native-byte pages, stable selection,
 honest query support and read-only shared-root preferences. Upstream-style Meson
 option defaults off; the distribution package enables it and excludes every local
 database storage, scanner, index store, rescan scheduler and folder monitor source.
Author: TemplarOS contributors
Origin: TemplarOS distribution overlay over upstream 05ed650ab101ee3d61795fa5eeeb5c32e1e366c3
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2026-10-08
License: GPL-2.0-or-later (new AppStream metadata CC0-1.0)

